{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_lolxh_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_lolxh_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"夜遊船","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_lolxh_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"d9319af1c23d4f598908af421e6ac26eda780f3cda1db6ae3c3075f59109f9a6","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"山發現自己丟了一枚銅鈕扣，不過幸好，他的新朋友小黑就在旁邊。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"師父？這裡好黑啊......我怎麼什麼也看不見......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無限","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，我在這。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們來這做什麼呀？是要教我新的招數嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無限","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小黑，感知自然靈質，不能僅僅只靠五感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無限","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"暫時封閉你的視覺，是為了幫助你更進一步地感受周圍金屬的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，什麼也看不到，好難啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無限","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的口袋裡裝了一個金屬球，你可以感知到多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......很模糊，但是可以感知到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無限","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那好，我要帶著它在你周圍走動，你需要靠感知金屬球來判斷我的位置，放心，不會離你太遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"師父，我要是做不到怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無限","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用著急，我們慢慢來。現在，你來捉我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，嗯......好像是在左邊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼也沒有，似乎在後面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"師父？！不對，不在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我得靜下心來，嗯......有了！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡，還是弄錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"師父，你在哪裡啊？！這也太難了......我好像做不到啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"師父，你說句話啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"師父，你在哪裡......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"師父？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵嗷——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小白","speakerId":"avg_npc_597_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（打哈欠）......小黑，你怎麼了，做噩夢了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小白","speakerId":"avg_npc_597_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摸摸小黑的頭）有我在，沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小白","speakerId":"avg_npc_597_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快睡吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（舔舔小白的手）咪嗚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小白","speakerId":"avg_npc_597_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在......沒事......呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（睡著了嗎？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（躡手躡腳爬下床）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（根本睡不著啊，不如去外面走走吧。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾天總是會夢到師父。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道什麼時候才能回去，都來這裡這麼久了，師父一定在找我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿根和小白，會不會也想爸爸媽媽和爺爺了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，得抓緊時間找到回去的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多也該回去睡了......不過，這裡是哪裡啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不是......迷路了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......哈......累死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這裡好像就是原來的地方？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這艘艦船太大了，根本找不到回去的路啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼晚了，連個可以問路的人都沒有。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是有人在打架嗎？！不好，難道是有壞人進來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我可得好好會會他了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聲音好像是從這個房間裡傳出來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？這裡不是幹員們平時訓練的地方嗎？那是......府先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是......府先生不穿那樣的衣服。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"離天亮還早，還能再做四組空擊訓練。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"呼呼，前手直拳刺拳，後手直拳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"吼！！！再來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好厲害的拳頭，才幾下就把沙包打得都變形了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道我和他誰比較強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"（晃晃耳朵）嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"（停止揮拳）誰？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"小菲林？！你是船上的病患？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是這裡的幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼小就成為了幹員嗎？難以置信......你都能做些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要小瞧我，我很厲害的，不信的話，我可以和你比試一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我的拳頭可能會收不住傷到你，還是算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用你收住，你可以盡全力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣......不好吧，看起來是我一個大人欺負一個小孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（擺開架勢）你不試試，怎麼知道呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"（他的姿勢很標準，下盤也很穩，看起來像是有些實力......算了，就當是陪小孩子訓練吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"那小朋友，你可千萬當心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出招吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"想不到你年紀輕輕身手就這麼敏捷，我對自己揮拳的速度非常自信，但還是沒法做出有效的攻擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（擦汗）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的拳頭真的很厲害，我差一點就躲不開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，看來我對艦船上幹員的實力認識得還不夠深刻啊。對了，小朋友，你怎麼這個時候來這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我睡不著，就出來走走，走著走著......就迷路了，不知道怎麼才能回宿舍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"你是剛剛來到羅德島吧，的確，這地方面積大分區又複雜，認路是有些困難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"小孩子在這個年紀不正是愛睏的時候嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我只是在想一些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"（原來現在的孩子這麼小就有這麼多的心事了嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，今天就到這裡吧，我先送你回去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我衣服上掉了一個鈕扣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鈕扣？回去再縫一個就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"這款鈕扣已經停產了，市面上很難再買到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那換別的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"這副鈕扣我一直很珍惜，它們對我來說挺特殊的，我的父親很喜歡在外衣上搭配這種鈕扣......丟了就太可惜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是先送你回去吧，之後再到白天去過的地方找找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們對你很重要吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，看到它們會讓我想起父親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......你的鈕扣是金屬的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來幫你找！我能夠感知金屬，這種金屬鈕扣，如果離得不遠，我可以確定它的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"居然還有這樣的源石技藝......小朋友，你還是先回去休息吧，明天我要是找不到再來麻煩你，如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，我的精神頭還很足，回去也睡不著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"那就拜託你了。對了，小朋友，我叫安東尼·西蒙，很高興認識你，或者你叫我的代號“山”也行。你叫什麼名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫小黑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我抱著你走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不要，我不是小孩子了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，好，我知道了，那你可跟緊點，不要再迷路了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"早上，我來這裡看過書，可能是把鈕扣掉在書架那邊了，你有感知到什麼嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......好像是有一個圓圓小小的東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（抬起手然後握拳）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是鈕扣，是一枚硬幣。你要嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"是一種遊戲幣啊......你還有感知到其他類似的金屬嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒有了，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，看來不在這裡。對了小黑，有玩過這裡的遊戲嗎？後勤部門為幹員們採購了很多遊戲卡帶和光碟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不怎麼玩，你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我現在不怎麼喜歡玩遊戲了，如果來這裡，多半只是為了借些書看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也不怎麼看書，上面的字我都不認識幾個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"那你想看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想！但是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得這裡有些畫冊，用於兒童開蒙......在這裡，找到了，給。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這上面都是些畫？謝謝你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你認真閱讀，無論是文字還是圖畫，都能讓你收穫許多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，走吧，拿好書，我們再去萊娜小姐的庭院看看吧，我中午幫她搬過貨物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......走了嗎？夜裡來玩就是為了避免碰到其他人，沒想到還是會有人來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們應該不會再回來了吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，接著存檔繼續玩吧，我看看......攜帶裝備，這一關清小怪適合用弓箭，但是最終戰卻更適合用近戰武器，怎麼選呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（放下手柄）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"綺良","speakerId":"avg_478_kirara_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許......剛剛他們進來的時候我應該試著上去打個招呼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"真是巧，我們一來就碰上了曇花盛開的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好漂亮的花，香氣淡淡的，很好聞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（吸一大口氣）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......走吧，我們接著去找你的鈕扣，這裡沒有，或許在下一個地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"小黑，不著急，你很喜歡這裡對嗎？我們可以再看一會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"這個庭院平時由萊娜小姐精心打理，裡面生長的花朵多是她調香所需，下次你要是再睡不好，可以找她配製一些安神的香氛放在房間裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊娜小姐？那站在那邊的男人是誰啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"（朝小黑瞥了一眼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是萊娜小姐請來這裡幫忙採摘鮮花的幹員吧......畢竟曇花只在夜晚開放。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此，怪不得他帶了那麼長的刀，割起來一定很俐落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗅嗅）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這曇花香氣好誘人，不知道可不可以吃，嚐一口應該也沒什麼吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（試圖咬一口）啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"真是奇怪的小鬼，賞花的反應居然是嚐一口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡奇怪了，這不可以吃嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"這位幹員，小孩子的想法總是很奇特，請不要介懷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"隨便你們，別來打擾我就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼遠應該打擾不到你工作吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"錯了，我並非在工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"我在等待生命即將湮滅的那一刹那所顯露的絕美景致，眨眨眼便有可能錯過，所以我必須全神貫注。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......沒有聽懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我想他的意思是曇花的花期只有幾個小時，如果不抓緊欣賞，很快就會凋謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這花只開這麼一會嗎？那我不吃了，看看就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）嘖，小孩子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個人......刀法應該很厲害吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，想和他切磋？但是千萬不要在這裡，萊娜小姐可不會樂意見到有人在她的庭院裡過招。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道啦，那我們去下個地方找鈕扣吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個庭院很漂亮，我下次想帶小白阿根去那裡，對了，小白和阿根是我的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"當然可以。萊娜小姐的庭院對所有幹員開放，你們隨時都可以去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"山先生，你怎麼這個時候出現在這裡？我還以為是伊桑呢。這位小朋友是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫小黑，我來幫山找他的鈕扣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣的，我的鈕扣可能丟在這裡了，角峰先生你有看到過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"我在打掃的時候會把幹員遺落的物品放在那個盒子裡面，你們可以看看有沒有你們要找的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，謝謝你，角峰先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"客氣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山，那個......我剛剛感知了，裡面並沒有金屬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣嗎？可這是我白天最後一個去過的地方，之後我便待在訓練室一直到遇見你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要不要從頭再找一遍，一定會找到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"不必麻煩了，小黑，我送你回宿舍吧......這麼晚了，小孩子睡不夠可是會長不高的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那鈕扣呢，你不找了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，或許是被別人撿走了吧，我明天發個尋物啟事看看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起......沒能幫到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"你願意幫忙，我已經很感激了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，沒有找到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，這孩子，沒找到鈕扣反而比我這個失主還要沮喪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"小黑，我這裡有些從家鄉帶的糖果，你拿去吃吧，不要傷心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，角峰先生......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"（摸摸小黑的頭）好了，我們走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"小黑，你想學識字嗎？我可以抽出時間來教你，最近任務排得並不滿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"角峰先生給你的糖你嚐過了嗎，味道如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還沒有吃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"小黑，你不要太沮喪了，只是一個小小的鈕扣，沒關係的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但對你來說它不是很重要嗎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜煙","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵嗚，又見面了，大塊頭，你怎麼還帶了一個可愛的小菲林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"夜煙小姐，這麼晚了，你怎麼在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜煙","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，是那傢伙想出來走走，所以我只好出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你旁邊沒有人啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜煙","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我的帽子，它好不容易安靜下來，你可不要打擾它哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這個姐姐......講話怪怪的。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜煙","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，我就是和這兩位幹員打個招呼，馬上就走，你不要鬧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜煙","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，下午在去訓練室路上撞到我的人就是這個大塊頭，但他也道歉了呀，你別這麼耿耿於懷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）她在和誰說話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）她的帽子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜煙","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，大塊頭，小菲林，我得走了，再待下去我就要講更多瘋瘋癲癲的話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（突然擰起眉頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（等等，她身上......沒錯，是在她身上！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，你可以先不要走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜煙","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小菲林，怎麼了，你想讓姐姐我講些奇怪的話給你聽嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不可以問問，你的口袋裡裝的是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜煙","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一些零碎的小玩意兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（伸出手然後突然握成拳）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜煙","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這是什麼源石技藝，為什麼我口袋裡的東西會朝你飛去？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（攤開手）山，這是你的鈕扣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，是的。夜煙小姐，為什麼我的鈕扣會在你那裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜煙","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚喵......被發現了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"夜煙小姐，我身上明明有更值錢的東西，你為什麼非要偷一枚銅鈕扣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜煙","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（吐舌頭）它的花紋實在是太好看了，我也是一時心動，看起來也不是什麼昂貴的東西，想拿來玩一玩後就還給你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它雖然不值錢，但對山來說是很重要的東西！丟了它山很著急的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣的，我的父親生前最喜歡的就是這種鈕扣，加上如今市面上很難買到，所以這鈕扣對我來說，確實意義非凡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜煙","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我不知道它是這麼貴重的東西......我無意傷害你，大塊頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜煙","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是之後有需要幫忙的地方，可以來找我？就當是彌補這一次的錯誤吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，夜煙小姐，鈕扣找到就好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜煙","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（擁抱小黑）謝謝你了，小菲林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？！你幹嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜煙","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是你，我就打破為自己立下的規則了，帽子和我都不會開心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（掙扎）知道了，你放開我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜煙","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（鬆開小黑）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜煙","speakerId":"avg_141_nights_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，那就再見啦，小菲林，你這麼可愛，我們以後可得多見見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她真奇怪，被我抓住偷東西，還要來謝謝我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"想必夜煙小姐作為盜賊，也有自己的底線吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不生她的氣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"比起生她的氣，我倒是更想感謝你，小黑。沒有你，我不會這麼順利地找到它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用謝，我們是朋友呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我很榮幸，可以成為你的朋友，小黑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼晚不睡，第二天你還能起來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，明天沒有很重要的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚為什麼睡不著，現在能和我說說了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——我想我師父了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"小黑，我之所以會用和父親一樣的鈕扣，是因為做他做過的事情時，會讓我覺得自己在靠近他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"即使他不在了，這樣的感覺依然很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"或許，你也可以試試，做一些你師父做過的事情，這會讓你好受些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"師父做過的事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"山先生！小黑！讓一讓，請讓一讓！我有急事！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"前面就是醫療部了，應該是有病人情況嚴重，需要急救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醫療部每天都會工作到這麼晚嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"醫療部的工作不分晝夜，只要有需要，他們就必須在崗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到了，那裡的燈，亮得像是在白天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"看你探頭探腦的，想要去看看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我認識裡面住的一位病人，不知道她最近怎麼樣了，我想去看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"那就走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"病人肺部的源石結晶擴張速度加快，肺功能極度衰弱，糟了，心音很低，準備急救設施！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"藥劑送到了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"來了，在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搭把手，我來實施急救。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來，他們都很忙。我明天再過來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏迷的病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵——呵——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"蘇蘇洛幹員，病人自主呼吸困難，需要撤除呼吸面罩，進行氣管插管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻醉醫師準備給藥！應急氣管！手術刀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"都已經準備好了，我來扶住他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"昏迷的病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（呼吸恢復）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（擦汗）好了，準備推去手術室進行下一步治療吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"小黑，你怎麼不走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個姐姐......好厲害啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，這些醫療幹員，一直是羅德島的驕傲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後派給我的任務，也是像他們一樣幫助這些石頭病人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"石頭病？你是說礦石病人嗎？我們和這些醫療幹員做的事情不太一樣，大多數情況下，我們的任務是為了改善感染者的處境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在一些極端的情況下，我們也需要對抗那些由感染者引發的暴力事件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來，像是我師父做的事情。他會幫助那些無家可歸的妖精，也會去追捕那些做了壞事的妖精。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"妖精？......不過，這樣不是很好嗎？小黑你要做的事情，正是你師父做過的事情。你感覺如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......很開心，也很自豪，可以和師父做一樣的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"正是如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在心情好點了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_lolxh_4067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"那這次真的該回去睡覺了，走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾本書看完了，找個機會再問問山有沒有其他的書可以推薦給我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是山嗎？正好他在，我去打個招呼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡來的小黑貓？Miss.Christine？不對，你不是她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那是誰？啊，忘記了山沒有見過我這個形態。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"你身上有小黑的氣味，難道是你認識他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（暫時就讓他先這麼認為吧......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喵嗷——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，你也想看這本書嗎？哈哈，來吧，靠過來，一起看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咪嗚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（上面的字都看不懂......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（打哈欠）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_596_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（好睏啊......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小黑","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"居然趴在我肩膀睡著了，這小傢伙，算了，翻書的動作輕些吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_131_flameb","aliases":["炎客"]},{"speakerId":"char_199_yak","aliases":["角峰"]},{"speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","aliases":["山"]}]}
